=============================================================================
SYSTEM COMPONENTS (not redistributed here)
=============================================================================

Windows: the binaries require the Microsoft Visual C++ 2015-2022
redistributable (VCRUNTIME140.dll, VCRUNTIME140_1.dll, MSVCP140.dll) and use
Windows system libraries (kernel32, user32, advapi32, ws2_32, iphlpapi,
ole32, oleaut32, shell32, winmm, crypt32, wintrust, bcrypt, wldap32,
odbc32, setupapi, and the Media Foundation libraries mfplat, mf and
mfreadwrite).

Linux: glibc 2.34 or newer, OpenSSL 3 (libssl.so.3, libcrypto.so.3) and,
when used, unixODBC and Python 3.11, all from the distribution.

None of these is shipped in this repository; they come from the operating
system and its packages.

